ArchWeb OS Server Android Package (.APK)
===================================
App Name: ArchWeb OS Server Client / Server Controller
Package Name: com.archweb.server
Version: 2.0.0
Release Date: 2026-07-17
Platform: Android 10+ (Termux / Native WebView Client)

Bu paket, ArchWeb OS yerel sunucunuzu (http://192.168.1.105:3000/) mobil cihazinizdan yonetmenizi ve mobil cihazinizda calistirilan Node.js sunucusuna baglanmanizi saglar.